<title>USA: Metris Cos Inc sets first qtly div $0.01.</title>
<headline>Metris Cos Inc sets first qtly div $0.01.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS PARK, Minn. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metris Cos Inc said Wednesday it had declared its first quarterly dividend, $0.01 per share, payable May 15, record May 13.</p>
<p>Metris is an information-based direct marketer of consumer credit products.</p>
</text>
